This is a goinstall-able mirror of modified code already published at:
http://git.nic.cz/redmine/projects/gofileutil/repository

Packages in this repository:

Install: $ go get github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil
Godocs: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil

Install: $ go get github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/storage
Godocs: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/storage

Install: $ go get github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/falloc
Godocs: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/falloc

Install: $ go get github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/hdb
Godocs: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/next-bin/go-sqlite/fileutil/hdb
